    <string name="onboarding_assistant_text">Android only starts the digital assistant with a shortcut such as a long press on Home. Choose Encircle as the assistant and confirm the notice.</string>
    <string name="onboarding_screen_text">On the same page, turn on “Use text from screen” and, where offered, “Use screenshot”. Encircle only reads the screen when you call it, and everything stays on your device.</string>
    <string name="onboarding_shortcut_text">%1$s You will try it in the next step.</string>
